WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.040
Hey, Bluebold here!

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.440
The apostrophe may be the most abused mark in English.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.160
Today, we set it free.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.440
An apostrophe does two jobs.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.760
It shows ownership,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.240
or it marks a contraction.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.740
It does not make a plain plural.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.320
Two cats. No apostrophe.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.460
Ask one question first:

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.900
how many owners?

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.680
One teacher owns a desk.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.180
Take teacher. Add apostrophe,

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.840
s. The teacher's desk.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.180
Several teachers share a lounge.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.900
Take teachers, which already ends in s,

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.460
and just add the apostrophe.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.800
The teachers' lounge.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.820
Your turn. Two dogs share one bowl.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.280
Where does the apostrophe go?

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:45.800
Go.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.240
After the s!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.760
Dogs, apostrophe. Two owners.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.080
Irregular plurals are different.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.080
Children doesn't end in s,

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.720
so it's children's books.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.320
Apostrophe s.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.820
And the famous one.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.960
I T S shows ownership.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.840
I T apostrophe S means it is,

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:11.800
or it has.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.200
To test it,

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:15.080
say it is.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.160
The cat licked it is paw?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.220
Nope. So, no apostrophe.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:21.600
How many owners?

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:22.840
Then place the mark.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.860
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.840
and go set some apostrophes free!
